G. Relation to the repo's Pythagorean lifts (scripts/pythagorean_lifts): none beyond 'both are conics'
   lift discriminant of the cell (k, s) is D = 4^k + 9^s (n^2 + ((3^s n + c)/2^k)^2 = y^2);
   square-triangular numbers live in Q(sqrt 2).  4^k + 9^s is odd, so never 2*square.
================================================================================================
   cell k= 2 s=1  (repo Set_3)   D = 4^k + 9^s = 25   perfect square: True
   cell k= 4 s=2  (repo Set_6)   D = 4^k + 9^s = 337   perfect square: False
